00:14:09.349 --> 00:14:11.224
But that's not what people tell you to do.

00:14:11.224 --> 00:14:12.222
- Yeah (inaudible)

00:14:12.222 --> 00:14:13.764
- 100%.

00:14:13.764 --> 00:14:14.970
